00:03:31.060 --> 00:03:33.380
So this should be blue.

00:03:33.380 --> 00:03:37.880
Suppose I have a vector v.

00:03:38.200 --> 00:03:41.800
And down here, actually,

00:03:42.420 --> 00:03:46.740
sorry I should have called that
u not that it really matters but

