00:06:15.180 --> 00:06:17.400
because we don't have just one
vector v.

00:06:17.400 --> 00:06:20.480
We have multiple v's, and their
span isn't just a line.

00:06:20.480 --> 00:06:23.160
and, rather, it's some more
