00:08:05.100 --> 00:08:06.700
The problem is,

00:08:06.700 --> 00:08:11.740
the hypothetical problem is the
same because this V1 and V2,

00:08:11.860 --> 00:08:13.640
their is still that same
subspace.

00:08:13.640 --> 00:08:15.940
Now I'm asking, among every
