00:08:22.080 --> 00:08:23.080
v2,

00:08:23.100 --> 00:08:25.680
or also including v3 and so on.

00:08:25.680 --> 00:08:28.380
There's infinitely many vectors
in this collection.

00:08:28.380 --> 00:08:32.280
Which one is closest to you?

00:08:32.280 --> 00:08:33.840
Projection of u onto v1.

00:08:33.840 --> 00:08:36.660
Exactly, it's the projection of
