What is that?

00:14:48.620 --> 00:14:49.440
Yeah?

00:14:49.440 --> 00:14:49.880
Nine.

00:14:49.880 --> 00:14:51.380
Nine, good.

00:14:52.400 --> 00:14:53.900
One indexed,

00:14:54.180 --> 00:14:57.040
just like all of math has been
so.

00:14:57.040 --> 00:14:57.940
OK,

00:14:57.940 --> 00:15:00.680
so anyways, your default
interpretation should be,

00:15:00.680 --> 00:15:02.580
I'm looking at three vectors in
