00:15:59.060 --> 00:16:00.060
Okay,

00:16:00.140 --> 00:16:03.060
which is doesn't it like there's
no reason to think that that's

00:16:03.060 --> 00:16:06.360
how it would work coming into
this but it happens to be true

00:16:06.360 --> 00:16:07.360
Okay

00:16:08.600 --> 00:16:11.040
Again that's just a preview of
